    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your lineage traces all the way to the first Ember Horn, and your physique displays this fact. You bear horns, spikes, or even very sharp, prominent teeth, and have a sturdier body. Your ivory is firm, but even as it breaks you regrow them quickly. You gain the Reptilian Arms feat and become Trained in Athletics. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your Athletics DC against creatures who are trying to Escape your Grapples.</span></p>"
